{
  "uid": "rift-verification-plane",
  "title": "Rift Cluster / Verification Plane",
  "tags": [
    "rift-cluster"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Journal entries (fleet)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "rift-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "rift-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rift:journal_entries:sum",
          "legendFormat": "entries",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Sum of rift_cluster_journal_entries{port} across the fleet."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Journal eviction rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "rift-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "rift-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rift:journal_evictions:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Rate of rift_cluster_journal_evictions_total, 5-minute window."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Pull-on-miss checks",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "rift-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "rift-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(rift_cluster_pull_on_miss_checks_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "checks/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "No recording rule exists for the pull-on-miss family yet, so this queries rift_cluster_pull_on_miss_checks_total directly. Rate of no-match requests the safety net inspected."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Pull-on-miss lagging",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "rift-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "rift-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(rift_cluster_pull_on_miss_lagging_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "lagging/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Raw metric (no recording rule yet). Rate of checks that found this node behind on replication."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Pull-on-miss retries",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "rift-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "rift-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(rift_cluster_pull_on_miss_retries_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "retries/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Raw metric (no recording rule yet). This is also the series that bounds the Latency Analytics dashboard's match-rate overcount."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Journal families not yet registered",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Not shown on this dashboard\n\nThe journal **partial-reads**, **merge-latency**, and **peer-pull-failure** panels are\ndeliberately absent. Their metric families \u2014\n`rift_cluster_journal_partial_reads_total`, `rift_cluster_journal_merge_seconds`, and\n`rift_cluster_journal_peer_pull_failures_total` \u2014 are not registered yet. They arrive\nwith issues #223 and #226.\n\nAn empty panel bound to a metric that does not exist would render as a silent\n\"No data\" that looks identical to a healthy-but-quiet system. That is worse than\nthis note: it invites reading \"no data\" as \"no problem.\" When #223/#226 land, add\nthe panels here and delete this note.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": []
}
